  }, "###Prompt:### _\"Now, what are the takeaways according to you?\"_\n")), mdx("p", null, "###Qwen3-Max:### 1. The Core Idea Is Elegant and Well-Motivated\nThe paper reframes the problem of \u201Ctranslationese\u201D through the lens of multi-objective alignment, borrowing from RLHF and style-transfer literature. This is a smart conceptual move: instead of treating naturalness as a post-hoc fix or a rigid training constraint (like Tagging), it treats it as a learnable reward signal that can be balanced with fidelity. This flexibility is a real strength."), mdx("ol", {
