    parentName: "li"
  }, "The MT-HT Reward Strategy Works\u2014But the \u201CWhy\u201D Matters\nThe finding that MT vs. HT classifiers yield better results than MT vs. OR is telling. It suggests that not all notions of \u201Cnaturalness\u201D are equally compatible with standard MT training data (which is mostly HT). This is an important methodological insight: if your training data is human-translated, pushing outputs toward original text may misalign the model\u2019s notion of \u201Ccorrect\u201D with its training signal. This nuance is often overlooked in style-transfer or debiasing work.")), mdx("li", {
